cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "MUST — Monitoring & Understanding SpatioTemporal Flood Risk Toolkit"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
abstract: >-
  An interactive flood-risk dashboard for East Africa. MUST replays daily
  exceedance-probability fields against recorded impacts so analysts can see
  flood risk evolve day by day, through a calendar-map index and per-day
  storymaps. It consumes published products from the grib-icechunks pipeline
  via a stable data-contract API.
keywords:
  - flood-risk
  - East Africa
  - exceedance-probability
  - ECMWF
  - early-warning
  - geospatial
  - data-visualization
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Bkoome/MUST-Code-for-earth"
